---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../../components/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dujiangyan Panda Base Tickets - Prices & How to Buy"
  description="Complete guide to Dujiangyan Panda Base tickets: entrance fees, where to buy, discount options, and tips for a smooth visit."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-accent-600 uppercase mb-3">Tickets</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-warm-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
      Dujiangyan Panda Base Tickets & Pricing
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-warm-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Everything you need to know about entrance fees, where to buy, and how to get the best value for your visit.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200">
      <p class="text-sm text-amber-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>⚠ Currently closed:</strong> Dujiangyan Panda Base has been closed since April 23, 2026 for renovations. This ticket information is preserved for reference when the base reopens. <a href="/closure-updates" class="underline font-medium">See current alternatives →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-warm-500">Last updated: July 2026</p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-warm-100">
            <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-medium text-warm-700">Ticket Type</th>
            <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-medium text-warm-700">Price (CNY)</th>
            <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-medium text-warm-700">Notes</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-warm-200">
          <tr class="bg-accent-50"><td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-accent-800">Adult</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-900 font-medium">58</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-600">Standard entry</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-warm-900">Student</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-900 font-medium">29</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-600">Valid student ID required</td></tr>
          <tr class="bg-warm-50"><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-warm-900">Senior (60+)</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-900 font-medium">Free</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-600">Chinese ID or passport required</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-warm-900">Child (under 1.2m)</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-900 font-medium">Free</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-600">Height measured at gate</td></tr>
          <tr class="bg-warm-50"><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium text-warm-900">Volunteer Program</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-900 font-medium">700-900</td><td class="px-5 py-3 text-warm-600">Includes entry, uniform, lunch, certificate</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-warm-500">Prices verified against official listings and visitor reports as of July 2026. Prices may vary during special events or Chinese national holidays.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <SectionHeader title="Where to buy tickets" />
    <div class="mt-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-warm-900">At the Gate</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-warm-600 leading-relaxed">Tickets available at the entrance ticket office. Cash and WeChat Pay accepted. Queues are usually short except during Chinese holidays. Foreign visitors must bring a passport.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-warm-900">Online Platforms</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-warm-600 leading-relaxed">Available on <a href="https://www.trip.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">Trip.com</a> (Ctrip), Meituan, and other Chinese travel platforms. Often slightly cheaper and lets you skip the ticket line. We recommend booking online during peak seasons (summer, Chinese holidays).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-accent-50 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <SectionHeader title="Tips for a smooth visit" />
      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-accent-500 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 shrink-0">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-warm-700">Arrive before 10 AM -- pandas are most active in the morning during feeding time.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-accent-500 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 shrink-0">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-warm-700">Bring your passport. Foreign visitors need it for ticket purchase and entry.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-accent-500 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 shrink-0">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-warm-700">Avoid Chinese national holidays (especially Golden Week in October) when the base gets crowded.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-accent-500 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 shrink-0">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-warm-700">The volunteer program must be booked separately and includes the entry fee. See our <a href="/volunteer-program" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">volunteer guide</a> for details.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
